Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

rworldmap distinguishes between Somalia and Somaliland, which is a bit unconventional. Somaliland is generally considered part of Somalia and has no ISO3 country code of its own. It was by pure guessing that I figured out that rworldmap uses SOL (which is "unofficially" used for Solomon Islands, according to http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Country_codes:_S.

